      "message": "fix(ui): defer provider checks during model edits\n\nAvoid cloud credential reads for Model-only edits. Debounce Ollama readiness checks and pin backend call counts and stale-result handling.\n\nComplete the requested Ollama and Gemini setup help. Track live provider tests in #3803 and rejected-key status in #3804.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nRefs #3781",
