        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-24T05:30:16Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): make AI provider Test usable after the reporter hand-test\n\n- Test reads Model like Send: trimmed, empty uses the preset default.\n- Test is disabled with a hover reason while no key is found.\n- A failed cloud Test names the cause from the HTTP status, the model\n  and host tried, what to try, and the redacted provider text; the app\n  log gets the same text.\n- Ollama: Test shows Testing... and a passed or failed result; a failed\n  check runs again every 5 s; an empty Model still tells if the server\n  answers; distinct texts for not running, not installed, invalid name.\n- The panel says that CamCraft does not start Ollama (ollama serve,\n  port 11434, menu bar app). The Anthropic help names the console\n  choice \"Somewhere else - Use an API key\".\n\nRefs #3781\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
